cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Якщо ви використовуєте цей програмний пакет, будь ласка, цитуйте його."
title: "AEGIS-RF: гібридна байєсівська просторова ідентифікація Wi-Fi у КІІ"
abstract: >-
  Demonstrative, fully reproducible software package for hybrid Bayesian spatial
  identification of IEEE 802.11 (Wi-Fi) sources in critical information
  infrastructure. Fuses an RSSI radiomap with FTM/RTT ranging, provides robust
  inference against adversarial manipulation (evil twin, deceptive ranging,
  deauthentication), critical-zone attribution, and Spatial Attribution Records
  for SOC/SIEM/SOAR integration. Applied project for Chapter 1 of the thesis.
type: software
license: MIT
version: "1.0.0"
keywords:
  - Wi-Fi localization
  - RSSI fingerprinting
  - FTM/RTT ranging
  - Bayesian sensor fusion
  - critical information infrastructure
  - adversarial robustness
  - SOC/SIEM
  - reproducibility
authors:
  - name: "The AEGIS-RF authors"
